{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0192_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0192_1000_p", "source_sha256": "68e0f02f168103c12f032800e24915fd478068e06c02b2a34a83e3165eaa15ac", "ja": "（インラインスケートを取り入れたパフォーマンスの\n練習をしに、茜と一緒に公園にやってきた）", "zh": "（为了练习融入直排轮滑的表演，和茜一起来到了公园。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0192_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0192_1001_023aka", "source_sha256": "b38a47ae903ff644d18434ecd787247a6b016113a476c8f1fc312960d5291bd6", "ja": "{$P$}ちゃん！　さっきのジャンプ、\n見てた？　公園中の視線をくぎ付けにしてたでしょ！", "zh": "{$P$}！刚才的跳跃\n看到了吗？公园里所有人的目光都被茜吸引了吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0192_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0192_1002_023aka", "source_sha256": "a1a31796bb4c4ecf65f4f28f8426bf6157290e48bf878b343a311f6d4c513522", "ja": "もっと見たい？　もっと見たいよね？　\nじゃあ特別にもう1回ね！　そーれっ……わ、わわ！？", "zh": "还想看更多？很想看更多吧？那就特别再来1次！看我的——……哇、哇哇！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0192_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0192_1003_se", "source_sha256": "8f51b6c048abac2c708542a8ce16efe08b79e454485e34ae78865eb1428bea4d", "ja": "バッターン！", "zh": "啪嗒——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0192_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0192_1004_p", "source_sha256": "99dcc802f115fb898e28a671b633246b255cf8510a8c33f16c2733436d365772", "ja": "うわっ、大丈夫か！？", "zh": "哇啊，你没事吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0192_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0192_1005_023aka", "source_sha256": "4e13992756a2f9210014bf91a2bc9027afba25e11e5ecdd17a915b61f1a38bed", "ja": "ったた～……平気平気！　カワイイ茜ちゃんは、\nケガもしないのだ～！　カワイイって、最強だからね☆", "zh": "哎呀呀～……没事没事！可爱的小茜，\n才不会受伤呢～！可爱可是最强的哦☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0192_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0192_1006_p", "source_sha256": "43fc2ea0be3c1fcd93573ad541228e7693a134543953dc8bc80c049676c1d3df", "ja": "……うん、本当に怪我はなさそうだな。\nよかった……気を付けてくれよ？", "zh": "……嗯，看起来确实没有受伤。\n太好了……以后要小心点哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0192_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0192_1007_023aka", "source_sha256": "464866ca6678f295a91ebf48c77ea6b607fc12fb39843163d5ab547416aa7c77", "ja": "くっ、茜ちゃんともあろう者が失敗するとは……。\nいや、違う！　これは、ある意味で成功だよ！", "zh": "可恶，堂堂小茜竟然会失败……  \n不，不对！这从某种意义上说是成功啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0192_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0192_1008_p", "source_sha256": "47ebbf678a02e954c3e6bc5058a938c7f9bdd4b7c4aefb5368f03fe344dd1454", "ja": "なんだって？", "zh": "你说什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0192_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0192_1009_023aka", "source_sha256": "3afb957d63f5a4aaf8a50eb453101a66469274b07389edace41a60b43e3b0de1", "ja": "たまにミスすると、こうやって心配してもらえる！\nいつも完璧だからこそできる事だね！　ニャハッ☆", "zh": "偶尔犯个错，就能像这样让人担心我！正因为平时总是完美无缺，才能做到这件事呢！喵哈哈☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0192_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0192_1010_p", "source_sha256": "b4ce76dea27dc7ce3745986d56a5992b779830e26971ddb3f13fce200dc43e53", "ja": "（……とか言いながら、茜は真面目に練習に\n打ち込んでいた。負けず嫌いなところもあるんだな）", "zh": "（……嘴上这么说着，茜却在认真投入练习。原来她也有不服输的一面啊。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
